# The charset of JetBrainsMono Nerd Font, the font Omarchy maps `monospace` to,
# as fontconfig reads it: hexadecimal code points and ranges, one line.
# tests/plugin/glyphs.test.js reads it where fontconfig or the font is not
# installed (CI); with both, it reads the installed faces and says when they
# differ from this file.
#
# Made 2026-10-13 (WP-178) under a private HOME and XDG_RUNTIME_DIR with
#   fc-list --format '%{charset}\n' ':family=JetBrainsMono Nerd Font:style=Regular'
# fontconfig 2.18.3; the face's fontversion 150994 (2.304 as 16.16 fixed point).
# The Bold, Italic and Bold Italic faces have the same charset.
# Refresh: the same command, the header's date and versions updated.
